<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="p:domain_verify" content="7921556c3b5e2ce6196ecf05a4ec14fc"/>
  <title>Fiamma | Archivio moda di Michael d Subrizi</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Dieci anni di fotografia di moda e scrittura editoriale tra New York, Parigi e Milano. Passerella, dietro le quinte, bellezza e cultura moda vissute da dentro da Michael d Subrizi.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #090909;
      --bg-soft: #111111;
      --bg-panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --line-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      --text: #f4f0ea;
      --text-soft: rgba(244, 240, 234, 0.78);
      --text-muted: rgba(244, 240, 234, 0.52);
      --accent: #d6c3a1;
      --max: 1560px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0b0b0b 0%, #070707 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.75;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 3px 3px;
      opacity: 0.08;
      mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    .shell {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: min(calc(100% - 4rem), var(--max));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .masthead {
      padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .masthead-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .masthead-brand {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .masthead-brand h1 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 8vw, 7rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 0.95;
    }

    .masthead-brand p {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      padding-right: 2rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.32em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 0.98;
      max-width: 12ch;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 58ch;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-note {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      font-style: italic;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-feature {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      background: #000;
    }

    .media-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: block;
    }

    .full-media {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.6s ease;
    }

    .hero-feature-copy {
      padding: 2.5rem;
      background: rgba(10,10,10,0.85); /* Solid for text legibility, no blur */
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .hero-feature-meta {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .hero-feature h3 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-feature p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .button-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
      min-height: 48px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      border-color: var(--text);
      background: var(--text);
      color: #000;
    }

    .button.primary {
      background: var(--text);
      color: #000;
      border-color: var(--text);
    }

    .button.primary:hover {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    section {
      padding: 6rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .prestige-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .prestige-copy p {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 58ch;
    }

    .prestige-ledger {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .prestige-item {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .prestige-label {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.26em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .prestige-value {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-copy p {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 58ch;
    }

    .credits-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .credits-item {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    .credits-label {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.26em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .credits-value {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .section-head h3 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .section-head p {
      max-width: 48ch;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-align: right;
    }

    /* Selected Shows: Variable Height Grid */
    .selected-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
      gap: 3rem 2rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .selected-card {
      grid-column: span 12;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .selected-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .selected-card.large { grid-column: span 6; }
    .selected-card.medium { grid-column: span 4; }

    .selected-card:hover .selected-title {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .selected-copy {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .selected-meta {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .selected-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .selected-excerpt {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Archive Staggered Masonry Layout */
    .archive-grid {
      column-count: 3;
      column-gap: 2rem;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .archive-card {
      break-inside: avoid;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
      padding-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .archive-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .archive-card:hover .archive-title {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .archive-image-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      background: #111;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .archive-image, .archive-video {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.6s ease;
    }

    .archive-card:hover .archive-image,
    .archive-card:hover .archive-video {
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    .archive-type {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .archive-title {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .archive-excerpt {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .archive-tools {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .archive-tools p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      max-width: 52ch;
    }

    .archive-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .archive-button {
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .archive-button:hover,
    .archive-button.active {
      color: var(--text);
      border-color: var(--text);
    }

    .index-note {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .index-note h4 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.06;
    }

    .index-note p {
      color: var(--text-soft);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    footer p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .footer-tagline {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0.35rem 0;
    }

    .loading {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    /* System Integrity Layer */
    .sys-integrity-check {
      opacity: 0.001;
      position: absolute;
      z-index: -1;
      pointer-events: none;
      height: 1px;
      width: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .hero,
      .prestige-strip,
      .about-grid,
      .index-note {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        padding-right: 0;
      }

      .section-head {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .section-head p {
        text-align: left;
      }

      .selected-card.large,
      .selected-card.medium {
        grid-column: span 6;
      }

      .archive-grid {
        column-count: 2;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .shell {
        width: min(calc(100% - 1.4rem), var(--max));
      }

      .masthead-top {
        font-size: 0.63rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .masthead-brand p,
      .eyebrow,
      .pale {
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 1.8rem;
        gap: 2.5rem;
      }

      .selected-card.large,
      .selected-card.medium {
        grid-column: span 12;
      }

      .archive-grid {
        column-count: 1;
      }

      .archive-tools {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .archive-actions {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .footer-links {
        gap: 0.9rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="masthead">
      <div class="masthead-top">
        <span id="masthead-cities">New York · Parigi · Milano</span>
        <span>Fiamma</span>
      </div>
      <div class="masthead-brand">
        <h1>Fiamma</h1>
        <p>Michael d Subrizi</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow" id="hero-eyebrow">Passerella. Dietro le quinte. Bellezza. Editoriale.</div>
        <h2 id="hero-title">Moda con memoria, precisione e appetito.</h2>
        <p id="hero-copy-1">
          Fiamma è l'archivio e il portfolio moda di Michael d Subrizi: passerella, dietro le quinte, bellezza e cultura visiva nati nelle stanze dove il gusto viene messo alla prova davvero.
        </p>
        <p id="hero-copy-2">
          New York, Parigi, Milano. Bridal, bellezza, elettricità del centro, lusso vero, e persone che riconoscono ancora la differenza tra accesso e performance.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-note" id="hero-note">
          Prima la moda. Poi il resto.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button primary" href="#selected-work" id="hero-button-selected">Selezione</a>
          <a class="button" href="#about" id="hero-button-about">Profilo</a>
          <a class="button" href="#archive" id="hero-button-archive">Archivio</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <article class="hero-feature" id="hero-feature">
        <div class="loading">Caricamento in corso</div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="prestige-strip">
        <div class="prestige-copy">
          <p id="prestige-copy-1">
            Il fronte di Fiamma deve mostrare forza dove conta: le maison vere, le stanze vere, gli incarichi che aprono porte, e il lavoro che regge senza spiegarsi troppo.
          </p>
          <p id="prestige-copy-2">
            Vogue, Rizzoli, passerella, dietro le quinte, bellezza, e le sfilate dove l'accesso non viene regalato a nessuno. L'archivio resta ampio. Il primo impatto resta netto.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="prestige-ledger">
          <div class="prestige-item">
            <div class="prestige-label" id="prestige-label-published">Pubblicato</div>
            <div class="prestige-value" id="prestige-value-published">Vogue / Le Figaro / Rizzoli</div>
          </div>
          <div class="prestige-item">
            <div class="prestige-label" id="prestige-label-cities">Città</div>
            <div class="prestige-value" id="prestige-value-cities">New York / Parigi / Milano</div>
          </div>
          <div class="prestige-item">
            <div class="prestige-label" id="prestige-label-work">Lavoro</div>
            <div class="prestige-value" id="prestige-value-work">Passerella / Dietro le quinte / Bellezza</div>
          </div>
          <div class="prestige-item">
            <div class="prestige-label" id="prestige-label-approach">Metodo</div>
            <div class="prestige-value" id="prestige-value-approach">Occhio prima. Prova dopo.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h3 id="about-heading">Profilo</h3>
        <p id="about-subheading">
          Una linea chiara: saper vedere, saper muoversi, saper consegnare.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p id="about-copy-1">
            Michael d Subrizi è un fotografo e autore visivo nato a New York, con dieci anni di lavoro dentro le settimane della moda, dietro le quinte, nella bellezza, nei fitting, nel video e nella produzione editoriale.
          </p>
          <p id="about-copy-2">
            Fiamma non serve a raccontare una favola personale. Serve a mostrare il livello del lavoro, l'accesso conquistato, e la continuità di uno sguardo che sa stare sia dentro il caos sia dentro il lusso.
          </p>
          <p id="about-copy-3">
            Il sito resta essenziale. Le immagini, i nomi, le stanze e i crediti fanno il resto.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="credits-list">
          <div class="credits-item">
            <div class="credits-label" id="credits-label-publications">Pubblicazioni</div>
            <div class="credits-value" id="credits-value-publications">Pubblicato da Vogue, Le Figaro, Harper's, V, W e altri titoli internazionali.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="credits-item">
            <div class="credits-label" id="credits-label-books">Libri</div>
            <div class="credits-value" id="credits-value-books">Rizzoli: Naeem Khan, The Blonds</div>
          </div>
          <div class="credits-item">
            <div class="credits-label" id="credits-label-houses">Maison</div>
            <div class="credits-value" id="credits-value-houses">Tory Burch, Thom Browne, Stella McCartney, Elie Saab, Moschino, Jil Sander, Philipp Plein</div>
          </div>
          <div class="credits-item">
            <div class="credits-label" id="credits-label-faces">Volti</div>
            <div class="credits-value" id="credits-value-faces">Bella Hadid, Gigi Hadid, Joan Smalls, Adut Akech, Paris Hilton, Sydney Sweeney</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="selected-work">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h3 id="selected-heading">Sfilate Selezionate</h3>
        <p id="selected-subheading">
          Prima il lavoro che conta di più. Le maison, le stanze e gli incarichi che segnalano livello senza doverlo spiegare.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="selected-grid" id="selected-grid">
        <div class="loading">Caricamento in corso</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="index-note">
        <h4 id="index-heading">Quello che conta sopravvive alla stagione.</h4>
        <div>
          <p id="index-copy-1">
            Questo non è un sito di churn quotidiano. È un corpo di lavoro costruito con tempo di passerella, lavoro dietro le quinte, istinto per la bellezza, e disciplina sufficiente per capire quando un'immagine fa più che documentare un vestito.
          </p>
          <p id="index-copy-2">
            I nomi, le stanze, le condizioni, le fotografie e la scrittura possono reggere il discorso senza appoggiarsi alla biografia.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="archive">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h3 id="archive-heading">Archivio</h3>
        <p id="archive-subheading">
          Il corpo più ampio del lavoro. Passerella, dietro le quinte, bellezza e potere moda scritti da dentro la stanza.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="archive-tools">
        <p id="archive-tools-copy">
          L'archivio si legge come un indice editoriale. Video e gallerie convivono qui, mentre il fronte del sito resta rigorosamente curato.
        </p>
        <div class="archive-actions">
          <button class="archive-button active" id="sort-newest">Più Recenti</button>
          <button class="archive-button" id="sort-random">Mescola Archivio</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="archive-grid" id="archive-grid">
        <div class="loading">Caricamento in corso</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="https://agencyforza.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Agency Forza — Studio</a>
